## How this report was produced

This report is rendered from `workflow_node_states.rationale` — one row per
audit node, written by the run — and from the parse failures listed above, if
any. That is the whole of what the renderer inspected.

It does **not** verify the run's machinery. Whether `accept:` rejected anything,
whether a repair ran and what preflight checked are all outside what this file can see:
they are capabilities of the pipeline, not findings of this report. For the run's own
record, read `workflow_repairs`, `workflow_decisions` and the per-node metrics.
